   rw [hΦ₁,hΦ₂,show (fun j=> Iona.BX K Φ ({Z₁ c},j))=(fun j=> Φ.B ({l},j)) from funext (fun j=> by change CrushJ A K₁ {l} j+_= _; rw[Crush_in _ _ (List.mem_toFinset.mpr h)]; exact zero_add _),show (fun j=>Iona.BX G' Φ' ({e (Z₁ c)},j))=(fun j=> Φ'.B ({l'},j)) from funext (fun j=>by change CrushJ B K₂ {l'} j+_= _; rw[Crush_in _ _ (List.mem_toFinset.mpr h₂)]; exact zero_add _)]
   have pχ:=uQ.book _ pB h; have B1(X:Finset I)(v:X⊆(W l).toFinset):∀ i∈A,i∉X:=fun i q t=>w₁.avoids _ h i (List.mem_toFinset.mp q) (List.mem_toFinset.mp (v t))
   have B2(X:Finset I)(v:X⊆(W l).toFinset):∀ i∈ B,i∉X.image e:=by
     intro i q hz; obtain ⟨j,f,rfl⟩:=mem_image.mp hz; exact w₂.avoids _ h₂ _ (List.mem_toFinset.mp q) (pχ.symm ▸ List.mem_map.mpr ⟨j,List.mem_toFinset.mp (v f),rfl⟩)
   have he(X:Finset I)(v:X⊆(W l).toFinset): X∈realm_C σ∧ X⊆Κ:=by
       have H:= (w₁.away l h).2.1; refine ⟨mem_filter.mpr ⟨mem_univ _,?_⟩,fun i t=>uQ.scope _ pB h _ (List.mem_toFinset.mp (v t))⟩; exact fun i p j q h=> List.inj_on_of_nodup_map H (List.mem_toFinset.mp (v p)) (List.mem_toFinset.mp (v q)) h -- tune implicit
